nk you in advance for your time and assistance.</p><p style=\"border:0px solid rgb(227,227,227);box-sizing:border-box;margin:1.25em 0px 0px;color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">Best regards,</p>"
