,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\"><br></p><p style=\"border:0px solid rgb(227,227,227);box-sizing:border-box;margin:1.25em 0px;color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2024-03-06 à 09.20.17_d65500bd.jpg\" width=\"534px\" height=\"231px\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/camtrapr/attach/4e4fb8730433/WhatsApp%20Image%202024-03-06%20%C3%A0%2009.20.17_d65500bd.jpg?part=0.1&amp;view=1\"><br></p><p style=\"border:0px solid rgb(227,227,227);box-sizing:border-box;margin:1.25em 0px;color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2024-03-06 à 09.23.16_2cd2d192.jpg\" width=\"534px\" height=\"280px\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/camtrapr/attach/4e4fb8730433/WhatsApp%20Image%202024-03-06%20%C3%A0%2009.23.16_2cd2d192.jpg?part=0.2&amp;view=1\"><br></p><p style=\"border:0px solid rgb(227,227,227);box-sizing:border-box;margin:1.25em 0px;color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">I initially suspected a version mismatch as I&#39;ve been working on different computers, but the issue persists across both systems. My main concern is that I can&#39;t seem to locate Bayesian p-values in the current output, and I&#39;m unsure if I&#39;m missing something obvious.</p><p style=\"border:0px solid rgb(227,227,227);box-sizing:border-box;margin:1.25em 0px;color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">Is there a way to switch back from species richness to Bayesian p-values, or am I overlooking a crucial step? I would greatly appreciate any guidance or insights you can provide.</p><p style=\"border:0px solid rgb(227,227,227);box-sizing:border-box;margin:1.25em 0px;color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">Thank you in advance for your time and assistance.</p><p style=\"border:0px solid rgb(227,227,227);box-sizing:border-box;margin:1.25em 0px 0px;color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">Best regards,</p>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;camtrapR&q